Data and images
---------------
Ship / equipment / quest / expedition / map data, illustrations and event
images are sourced from the KanColle Wiki (kctwili) community:
  - https://zh.kcwiki.cn/          (text data, CC BY-NC-SA)
  - https://api.kcwiki.org/        (game master data)
  - https://upload.kcwiki.org/     (illustrations)
  - https://akashi-list.me/        (daily improvement table)
  - https://db.kcwiki.cn/          (development / drop statistics reference)

They remain the property of their respective authors and are used here for a
non-commercial fan tool only. This project is not affiliated with DMM,
Kadokawa or C2 Kikan.

